  <h1>Haskell vs Rust: two answers to the same question</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Jul 31, 2026</span><span>8 min read</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span><span class="tag">#types</span></div>
